<style>
        .policy-hero { background: var(--color-bg-alt); padding: var(--space-8) 0; text-align: center; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border); }
        .policy-container { max-width: 750px; margin: 0 auto; padding: var(--space-6) var(--space-3); }
        .policy-container h2 { font-size: var(--font-size-lg); margin: var(--space-5) 0 var(--space-2); }
        .policy-container p, .policy-container li { color: var(--color-text-muted); font-size: var(--font-size-sm); line-height: 1.7; }
        .policy-container ul { padding-left: var(--space-4); margin-bottom: var(--space-3); }
        .policy-container li { margin-bottom: var(--space-1); }
    </style>

<section class="policy-hero"><h1 class="text-3xl mb-2">Privacy Policy</h1><p class="text-muted">Your privacy matters. Here's how we handle your data.</p></section>

    <div class="policy-container">
        <p><strong>Effective Date:</strong> January 1, 2026 &nbsp;|&nbsp; <strong>Last Updated:</strong> March 2026</p>

        <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>When you visit our store or make a purchase, we collect the following types of information:</p>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Personal Information:</strong> Name, email address, shipping address, phone number, and payment information when you make a purchase.</li>
            <li><strong>Device Information:</strong> Browser type, IP address, time zone, and cookies for site functionality.</li>
            <li><strong>Order Information:</strong> Products purchased, order value, and transaction details.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>Process and fulfill your orders</li>
            <li>Communicate with you about your order (confirmations, tracking, updates)</li>
            <li>Send marketing communications (only with your consent — you can opt out anytime)</li>
            <li>Improve our website, products, and customer experience</li>
            <li>Prevent fraud and secure transactions</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>3. Data Sharing</h2>
        <p>We <strong>never sell</strong> your personal data. We share information only with:</p>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Payment processors</strong> (Stripe, PayPal) to process transactions securely</li>
            <li><strong>Shipping carriers</strong> (USPS, FedEx, DHL) to deliver your orders</li>
            <li><strong>Analytics tools</strong> (anonymized data only) to improve our service</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>4. Cookies</h2>
        <p>We use cookies to remember your cart, preferences, and provide a seamless shopping experience. You can control cookie settings in your browser.</p>

        <h2>5. Data Security</h2>
        <p>All transactions are encrypted using SSL/TLS technology. Payment information is processed through PCI-compliant payment processors and is never stored on our servers.</p>

        <h2>6. Your Rights</h2>
        <p>You have the right to:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Access, correct, or delete your personal data</li>
            <li>Opt out of marketing communications at any time</li>
            <li>Request a copy of your data</li>
            <li>File a complaint with a data protection authority</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>7. Children's Privacy</h2>
        <p>Our store is not intended for children under 16. We do not knowingly collect personal data from children.</p>

        <h2>8. Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p>We may update this privacy policy from time to time. Changes will be posted on this page with an updated effective date.</p>

        <h2>9. Contact Us</h2>
        <p>For privacy-related questions, contact us at:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Email: <strong>privacy@aura.com</strong></li>
            <li>Or visit our <a href="/pages/contact" class="link">Contact Page</a></li>
        </ul>
    </div>